# Sudden Substitution (split second): "Exchange control of target noncreature spell and target creature. Then the spell's
# controller may choose new targets for it." Bot2's Lightning Bolt aims at Bot1; Bot1 trades it for its own Llanowar
# Elves (CR 112.2, 701.12), and as the Bolt's new controller aims it at Bot2. Split second (CR 702.61a): while the spell is
# on the stack Bot2 is offered no second Bolt, though it has the mana (refused); once it has resolved, Bot2 can cast one
# (the control). Bolt's 3 damage goes to Bot2 (17), and Bot2's second Bolt takes Bot1 to 17. The Elves are Bot2's.

